  "schema:name": "J4.1 on the DPI-H RA",
  "schema:description": "Journey J4.1 (J4.1 Read a family member's records at the point of care abroad): the people assigned to it (its BPMN lanes), the systems that serve it (the system actors that play its lanes, each holding its parts) and the other country’s parts it hands over to, each country’s instances of the DPI-H RA building blocks those parts specialize, and the RA capabilities it realizes.",
